---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="A little about this starter project.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">About</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">
      This is a placeholder page showing how a second static route reuses the
      same <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">Layout.astro</code>
      (and therefore the same Header/Footer) as the home page, with only the
      content inside <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">&lt;slot /&gt;</code> changing.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
